comments[21]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-18T19:32:35.295Z",codex-agent,"Companion specification: pm-cli-website-y3xy. Read-only reference; implementation and all evidence belong to this package. Plan: certified environment, SDK ledger, atomic reservations and digest resume, bounded adapters and commands, measured local eval, full fleet gates. No agents, publication or remote writes."
  "2026-10-18T19:51:35.483Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proofs: node test/revert.ts passed 3/3. Removing only the reservation budget guard made the exact-boundary regression fail (exit 1). Replacing only completed-digest lookup with no reuse made the real SIGKILL resume regression fail (exit 1). Removing only the partition fit check made slice-budget reconstruction regression fail (exit 1). Original source SHA-256 bytes were restored after each mutation; tests import authored TypeScript directly."
  "2026-10-18T20:05:10.957Z",codex-agent,"Implementation preflight passed: frozen-source coverage is 100 percent statements/branches/functions/lines across all 19 authored source and tooling files; 71 unit tests passed with zero failures, skips, cancellation or TODO. Packed npm/npx and Bun/bunx acceptance passed 1/1. Docstrings: 57/57 declarations; jscpd zero clones at unchanged zero threshold; eslint clean. Three behavioral revert proofs passed. Strict tracker health and separate validation pass with zero warnings. Final committed-head npm and Bun release gates follow. Known SDK integration gaps: --field needs active registration despite persisted schema; pm-changelog needs canonical full output controls; package describe uses the full package name. Snapshot storage scale follow-up: pm-rlm-3isb."
  "2026-10-18T20:14:45.154Z",codex-agent,"Isolated-identity npm run release:check passed all 12 top-level gates: 71/71 unit tests, 1/1 packed npm/npx plus Bun/bunx consumer acceptance, zero failures/skips/cancellation/TODO. Measured 19/19 source files; statements 1444/1444, lines 1444/1444, branches 555/555, functions 75/75. Docstrings 57/57; duplication zero clones; eslint and identity zero violations; production audit zero vulnerabilities; 47/47 packed files allowlisted; changelog and one attested publish invocation verified. A fresh no-local clone completed pinned npm ci, strict merge-driver-aware health 10/10 and separate validation 10/10 with zero warnings and no tracked changes. Final npm and Bun gates will run on the evidence commit; claims remain released and all work items stay open for orchestrator review."
  "2026-10-18T21:15:51.726Z",codex-agent,"Review round 1: verified GitHub issue #4 and all ten inline findings at 20521fa. Work continues on the existing feature branch in a review worktree. Plan: durable typed child refusals, projected prompt checks, scoped privacy, identity environment isolation, public revision eval copies and local transport, then calibrated measured eval and unchanged npm/Bun gates. No review threads will be replied to or resolved."
  "2026-10-18T21:30:57.660Z",codex-agent,"All ten review findings are implemented: current publication wording; sanitized Git selection/config environment; preserved typed adapter diagnostics; projected observation/context refusal; scoped privacy; valid complete-item stuffing JSON; verified public revision copies excluding local dirty/untracked data and symlinks; explicit loopback-only Ollama transport; JSON answer-envelope scoring; per-attempt new-root attribution. Regression evidence is in test/review.test.ts, test/tooling.test.ts, test/adapters.test.ts, test/eval.test.ts and test/eval-source.test.ts. No thread replies or resolutions."
  "2026-10-18T21:59:37.124Z",codex-agent,"Review round 1 code gates passed in separate isolated HOME environments with global/system Git config disabled: npm and Bun release checks 12/12 each; 85/85 tests; packed consumer acceptance 1/1; coverage 100/100/100/100 (1514 statements/lines, 634 branches, 77 functions; 19 files); docstrings 58/58; duplication zero clones across 37 files; production audit zero; npm package 47 allowlisted files; six behavioral revert proofs. Privacy scan matched zero local home/worktree paths or active environment secrets in 83 candidate tracked files. Live evaluation continues separately; its final measurements will be committed with README and tracker evidence."
  "2026-10-18T22:06:49.863Z",codex-agent,"Review round 1 delivery: issue #4 and all ten inline findings fixed; seven behavioral revert proofs; calibrated live evaluation recorded in pm-rlm-umh4 and README. The measured small model reached no child calls and is worse than a constant-zero reference on this zero-heavy sample. Code commit 9d57dd6 passed isolated npm/Bun checks 12/12 with 85 tests and full four-dimension coverage; final exact-head checks and CI follow the measurement commit. Remaining limits: ledger storage amplification (pm-rlm-3isb) and development glob advisories (pm-rlm-wiav). No companion or other fleet tracker was modified. All work items remain unclosed for orchestrator verification."
  "2026-10-18T23:24:22.248Z",codex-agent,"Review round 2: rechecked clean branch at 76a20eb and existing items. Address all six new review threads with focused regressions: bounded transport body, scope input errors, escaped privacy needles, validated checkpoints/settings, HTTPS credential transport, and verified archive bytes. Redesign evaluation deterministically from public tracker truths with diverse numeric and id answers; record histogram and constant baselines. No live model rerun; preserve previous measurements as historical. Run both unchanged release gates, behavioral revert proofs, then push and wait for CI."
  "2026-10-18T23:31:48.686Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert evidence: node test/revert.ts passed 16/16 proofs, each requiring an assertion failure after removing only the named invariant, with exact source hashes restored. New proofs cover checkpoint call validation, checkpoint settings validation, response byte cap, scope SyntaxError diagnosis, JSON-escaped privacy needles, HTTPS credential transport, verified archive paths and bytes, and seeded answer-frequency cap. Retained proofs cover calibrated limits, terminal child refusals for issue 4, projected observation guard, scoped privacy, atomic reservations, resume-by-digest after SIGKILL, and bounded partitioning. Focused node --test test/round2.test.ts test/eval-source.test.ts passed 7/7. The tracker-linked adapter test run passed 2/2 commands with zero failure categories."
  "2026-10-18T23:38:54.840Z",codex-agent,"Round 2 delivery gates: isolated npm run release:check and bun run release:check both passed 12/12 top-level gates with unchanged thresholds. Each passed 91/91 tests and 1/1 packed npm/npx plus Bun/bunx consumer acceptance. Coverage: 1564/1564 statements and lines, 679/679 branches, 78/78 functions across all 19 authored files (100% in every dimension). Docstrings 59/59; jscpd zero clones across 40 TypeScript files; identity zero violations; production audit zero; npm pack dry-run 47 allowlisted files. Behavioral revert runner passed 16/16; linked tracker test run passed 2/2 commands. New eval design audit passed with 24 exact tasks, 21 answer values and constant baselines 2/24 most-common and 1/24 zero; no live model rerun. All six round-2 findings fixed with regressions, none refused. CI will be checked after pushing; review threads remain untouched. Existing storage amplification and development dependency advisory follow-ups remain open, and new-design model accuracy remains unmeasured pending the orchestrator."
  "2026-10-19T00:40:57.413Z",codex-agent,"Round 3: confirmed clean aa3787b and reused existing budget, ledger, adapter and eval Features. Issue 5 is tracked separately as pm-rlm-sr0b. Implement two-phase settlement in the same checkpoint as each model response; pending steps retain worst-case reservations across crashes and settled steps debit once. Add real-process pre-response SIGKILL and twenty-step regressions plus empty-response recovery. Fix redirect rejection, rejected-body cancellation, typed replay observation refusals and Git replacement isolation. Verify with real SDK trackers before the single authorized glm-5.3:cloud eval at a shared supported context no larger than 131072. No answer-based tuning."
  "2026-10-19T00:55:37.994Z",codex-agent,"Pre-eval verification: 98/98 tests passed with 100% statements/lines (1584/1584), branches (716/716) and functions (79/79) across all 19 authored files. TypeScript, ESLint, docstrings and zero-duplication checks pass. All 24 behavioral revert proofs pass, including settlement, pending SIGKILL, completed/interrupted issue 5, redirects, rejected-body cancellation, missing spawn observations and Git replacement isolation, plus prior engine/partition guards. Ollama metadata reports glm-5.3:cloud context length 1048576. The single authorized eval will use 131072 context for both arms, 512 output allocation, existing 300000 budget, depth 2 and eight ledger calls. Prompts and seeded questions are unchanged."
  "2026-10-19T02:16:29.764Z",codex-agent,"The single cloud eval is complete and all 24 row charges reconcile exactly as recorded usage plus pending reservation plus delivered-read charge. Both arms scored 0/24. RLM mean recorded tokens 146296.92, wall seconds 183.78, requests 19.17; stuffing mean tokens 18471.58, wall seconds 5.37. Child reach 0/24. RLM refusals budget 15 and model/transport 9; stuffing model/transport refusals 8; RLM invalid-action refusals 451. Mean RLM charged/used/pending/read tokens 151634.96/146296.92/5338.04/0.00. Most-common and zero constant baselines remain 2/24 and 1/24. Protocol compliance follow-up pm-rlm-58i4 is open, scoped to independent synthetic holdouts and separate quota authorization. No more live model calls will be made. This is a measured null result, not evidence of recursive aggregation quality. The two-phase and recovery software invariants are separately verified by real SDK tests and behavioral reversions."
  "2026-10-19T02:34:48.750Z",codex-agent,"Round 3 final release checks passed in separate empty HOME directories with global/system Git configuration disabled: npm run release:check 12/12 gates and bun run release:check 12/12 gates. Each passed 98/98 tests, zero skips/cancellations/todos, and 1/1 packed npm/npx plus Bun/bunx install/discovery/render acceptance. Both coverage reports met unchanged 100% statement/branch/function/line thresholds over 19 authored files; final Bun report covered 1584/1584 statements and lines, 717/717 branches and 79/79 functions. Docstrings 60/60; zero clones across 46 TypeScript files; identity zero violations; production audit zero; 47 allowlisted packed files. All 24 behavioral revert proofs passed. All 99 staged files passed the local-path scan and all 11 existing history prefixes were preserved. Measured implementation fingerprint still matches the single completed cloud invocation. Seven work items touched, including issue 5 and deferred protocol-compliance follow-up; work items stay unclosed. Next: local commit, push, exact-head clone validation and CI; no more model calls."
  "2026-10-19T03:21:11.466Z",codex-agent,"Round 4: verified the existing head and four unresolved findings. Reusing command, ledger and evaluation features for a package-wide sweep of environment filters, CLI operands, portable privacy needles and marker-based document replacement. No new live inference will run; the measured round-3 artifact remains unchanged."
  "2026-10-19T03:25:28.837Z",codex-agent,"Round-4 sweep changes: shared case-insensitive Git filtering now covers identity auditing, verified eval copying and its fixture; coverage removes mixed-case runner variables; audit and packed consumers remove every casing of npm script policy and userconfig before setting one isolated config. All command positional/string operands reject blanks; all three numeric flags require unsigned decimal safe integers and existing settings bounds. Privacy handles shallow roots, Windows drive/UNC casing, separators and trailing separators; identity checks also cover mixed-case backslash home paths. The offline report uses unique ordered markers, validates before writes, and removes obsolete prose-based migration edits. Saved live measurements are unchanged."
  "2026-10-19T03:28:05.386Z",codex-agent,"Additional whole-package operand sweep: the coverage, docstring and identity script CLIs now share a nonblank optional repository-root validator, preventing empty paths from silently selecting the current checkout. Regression executes all three entry points with empty and whitespace-only operands. The first coverage run identified an unreachable separator branch, now removed; the mixed-case coverage regression permits c8 to re-establish its own uppercase instrumentation variable while proving inherited variants are absent."
  "2026-10-19T03:30:19.183Z",codex-agent,The environment sweep also found the recovery worker blanking only the canonical test-context key. It now removes every spelling while preserving coverage inheritance; coverage uses the same helper. Real Git policy fixtures and packed consumers now discard inherited Git overrides too. Windows privacy additionally covers forward-slash UNC roots and JSON-escaped path names. A proof run exposed that reverting the quality-root guard could invoke the full coverage gate recursively; the regression now checks the identity entry first to fail immediately under that revert.
  "2026-10-19T03:31:15.781Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert evidence: node test/revert.ts passed 35/35 mutations, including eleven new round-4 proofs and all twenty-four prior proofs. Each focused regression failed with only its invariant removed, and the harness verified exact SHA-256 restoration of every mutated source. New proofs cover Git/npm/coverage/recovery environment casing, numeric/string/root CLI operands, root and Windows privacy, identity path matching and marker replacement."
  "2026-10-19T03:35:41.495Z",codex-agent,"Round-4 validation: npm run release:check and bun run release:check each passed 12/12 gates under separate empty HOME directories with global/system Git configuration isolated. Each passed 108/108 unit tests and 1/1 packed npm/npx plus Bun/bunx acceptance; no skipped, canceled or todo tests. Coverage is 100% statements/branches/functions/lines across all 20 source files. Docstrings 64/64, jscpd zero clones across 48 TS files, production audit zero, package allowlist 47/47. Revert proofs 35/35. Four existing items hold round-4 evidence; no live inference ran. CI and a fresh-clone tracker check follow the single push; their exact-head results will be recorded in the PR and final handoff."
